- Capacity ceiling scenario finds the concurrency point where the CipherBox API degrades for BYO users
- Mixed workload scenario reports CB-only and BYO segments separately to measure cross-impact
- Baselines document captures results with comparison to 19.2 numbers
</success_criteria>

